WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Hurt in a car wreck?

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.310
Wouldn't it be great if you could push a button and reverse everything?

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.410
No wreck, no bill, no fight with the insurance company?

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.650
Now that would be big.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:09.660
Really big.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.020
Push these buttons and we'll speak to the bill collectors for you.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.570
We'll deal with the insurance company?

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.110
We'll get you every dollar you deserve.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.030
And we'll work to keep you out of court.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.600
That's a big help.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:20.760
Really big help.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.440
No button can reverse a car wreck.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.360
But these buttons will get you all the help you need from us.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.880
Martin, Harding & Mazzotti.
